  <p>The marketplace rows follow a structure Chinese production references agree on.</p>

  <blockquote class="evidence">Every Chinese production reference checked builds a listing from the same named parts: a main image set with a pure-white-background image inside it, a long scrolling detail page, a separate mobile detail page, a size and specification chart, store decoration banners, and short video. The parts are stable. The dimensions attached to them are not.</blockquote>
  <p class="source">Source: eight independent Chinese design, tool and seller-education references collected September 2026, compared on their deliverable lists only, with every number they carried set aside.</p>

  <p>The film rows come from one delivered launch, quoted in the section on what can be generated.</p>

