  <p>Two gaps shape the table. No rule, ruling or code clause on the "screen images simulated" line itself turned up in the codes, rulings and policy statements read. And no ruling aimed at battery life, brightness or screen size claims was found, so the specs rows rest on the general substantiation rules.</p>

  <h2>What have regulators ruled against?</h2>

  <p>No marketplace rejection notice was available to this research. The reasons below are regulator findings, not platform rejections. Each one is a mistake a launch asset can repeat.</p>

  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th scope="col">Asset ruled on</th>
